 and sam are practicing in  a music studio for their concert inside  the palace the boy invites sam to come  to the bramble bone concert with him  which she agrees to he is surprised and  confused when sam manages to smell the  garlic naan in his mouth which he ate  two days ago sam comes across the old  stuff of her and her father and recalls  the memory of her father used to call  him snowflakes because she was so  special to him that night she attends a  pre-event before the coronation of  eleanor and suddenly remembers that she  has promised mike to come to a party  with him she lies to her mother  immediately changes her appearance into  a rock girl and then catches up with  mike  however since both of them don't have id  cards they are forbidden to enter the  building they luckily come across the  workers at the back door and sam somehow  manages to see the guy entering the  door's passcode from a distance which  surprises mike they then get into the  building and enjoy the party where sam  suddenly is able to hear every sound  that is occurring in the club including  heartbeat and the sound of insect  buzzing  she feels uncomfortable and dizzy at the  same time forcing her to trigger the  fire alarm to stop the concert because  of that they get arrested again  mike realizes that something is wrong  with his friend since that moment when  she was able to smell what he had had  for lunch two days ago not long after  they are released and are picked up by  their parents  catherine decides to send her daughter  to a summer school to make up for  missing her test  meanwhile inmate 34 secretly calls his  partner praising him or her for the  apple idea it is revealed that catherine  is the one who put him in the cell while  waiting for his move he keeps  strengthening his telekinesis skill and  secretly stalks sam the next day she  attends the summer school where she  meets january claiming that her dad was  friends with sam's uncle there is also a  socially awkward mateo tuma and of  course the popular roxanna a few moments  later the teacher responsible for the  summer class professor james morrow  shows up at the class he then reveals  that each of them is a second born royal  and they secretly possess a unique  superpower without them realizing he  adds that the purpose of the summer  school is to train them to join the  secret society of second-born royals  turns out that catherine is the head of  the society program which shocks sam  she explains that the society was formed  to protect the monarchies from threats  and criminals all around the world the  bad news is the students who do not pass  the training will have their memory  erased and they won't remember that they  have the superpower they begin their  first training where they are ordered to  reach the pyramid however it's not as  easy as it seems the room is filled with  laser weapons which shoot the cocky tuma  slow but sure the students begin to  discover their own superpower one by one  roxanna realizes that she has the power  to be invisible while tuma's power is to  influence people to do whatever he  commands  on the other hand sam's supersense makes  her to be more sensitive to surroundings  allowing her to act faster than the  others  long story short all of the students are  beaten by the first challenge  after that january discovers her  superpower which allows her to steal  others power temporarily by touching  them while mateo manages to control  insects after the session the girls  share their problems as the second born  in the family to each other when sam's  backup phone suddenly rings the next day  the students continue their training  where jamex explains that they need to  be able to control their powers  because they have a unique superpower  james assigns a specialized training for  each of them  sam is told to focus on voices to  sharpen her super senses while tuma is  given a dog named charlie to improve his  interactions with others on the other  side roxanna is forced to bring out her  superpower under the extreme weather  while mateo is practicing his control  over the insects  january is brought to a swimming pool  where she has to maintain her stolen  power from anna whose ability is  breathing underwater james even tests  his students in lunch by deliberately  bringing sam poison food to sharpen her  senses  january then shares her favorite apple  to her that night mike's dad spots his  son calling the princess he advises him  not to get too close to the royals  because they are not on his level the  next day sam approaches her mother who  surprisingly shows her an underground  headquarters where a lot of unique stuff  is stored there  one of them is a dna based nano device  that can target specific people with  specific genetic sequences catherine  gives her some tricks to master her  superpower after that all of the  students have managed to master their  own superpower except roxanna sam  manages to guess correctly some of the  voices mateo is getting better at  controlling the bees charlie obeys  tuma's orders and january hits her best  records in holding breath underwater  since roxanna is the one who is not  progressing james deliberately threatens  to do a live streaming of her with messy  hair and no makeup with this trick  roxanna eventually manages to bring out  his invisibility power the students  eventually have reached their peak and  james is very happy with the result  later that night sam is supposed to do a  street concert with mike however james  suddenly awakens the students forcing  them to do their very first mission to  protect a jewel from being stolen they  arrive at the location and sam manages  to spot the thief with her super senses  they chase after the thief only to find  out that she is actually january's coach  they have been tricked and failed to  protect the jewel james is disappointed  with them and decides to cancel the  following day's training  sam apologize