e superpower  stolen from tuma silently sneaks into  the underground headquarters  she orders the guard to free edmund from  his custody and it is revealed that she  was the one who did the apple trick  she then gets back to her friends  ordering them to follow her and lock  them inside the cell  mateo informs sam about january through  one of his b's with her super senses she  manages to track edmund and immediately  chases after him the ceremony is now in  progress and edmund arrives at the  cathedral setting up a nano device that  will wipe out everyone with a royal  bloodline  meanwhile sam realizes that january is  going after her so she runs to mike's  house and asks for his help at first he  refuses to help her but sam apologizes  and reveals her secret to him they  eventually team up and manage to take  out january who admits that she made a  deal with edmund so that she could rule  they regroup with the other students and  decide to stop edmund together he claims  that a world without royals will give  freedom to other people  sam tuma and roxanna managed to distract  him and successfully lure him to a room  where a miniaturized chamber has been  installed to weaken his telekinesis  mike reprogrammed the nano device which  eventually traps edmund inside on the  other side the coronation is completed  without any distraction and eleanor has  officially become illyria's new queen  sam roxanna mateo and tuma finally get  accepted into the society as james  recovers from his injuries  catherine reveals the secret society to  the new queen who promises to sam that  she will give the people of illyria a  choice by adding parliament alongside  the monarchy the society is informed  that january has escaped and challenges  them to find her  with their newest suit they proceed to  the next mission  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching
 

